   'Roney honors Constable Ronan Kerr, 25, of the Police Service of Northern Ireland. He was killed on April 2, 2011, by a car bomb outside his home in Omagh, Northern Ireland.

Each of the 4 rounds has three 200 m runs, each followed by 11 reps of a barbell lift: thrusters, then push presses, then bench presses. One barbell (135 lb / 95 lb) covers all three lifts, so you also need a bench. That is 2,400 m of running and 132 barbell reps. The thrusters and push presses work your shoulders, and the bench press hits them again, so your pressing fades fast.',
   '[{"name": "Run", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "A quick, controlled run. Use it to get ready for the next lift."}, {"name": "Thrusters", "reps": "11", "tip": "Front squat below parallel and drive the bar overhead in one move.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "Breathe and shake out your arms."}, {"name": "Push Press", "reps": "11", "tip": "Dip at the knees and drive the bar overhead. Lock out every rep.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "Get set to bench as soon as you come back."}, {"name": "Bench Press", "reps": "11", "tip": "Touch your chest and lock out every rep. Use safety arms or a spotter.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Set up the bench and bar next to where your runs start", "Break the thrusters before they slow you down", "Always bench with safety arms or a spotter"]'::jsonb,
