   'Lower the barbell to 95 lb / 65 lb or less. Use dumbbells for the bench press if you have no rack or spotter. Newer athletes can do 3 rounds, or cut each set to 7 reps.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Roney workout?", "answer": "4 rounds for time of: 200 m run, 11 thrusters, 200 m run, 11 push presses, 200 m run and 11 bench presses. The barbell is 135 lb / 95 lb."}, {"question": "How many total reps are in Roney?", "answer": "132 barbell reps (44 thrusters, 44 push presses and 44 bench presses) plus 2,400 m of running."}, {"question": "Do I use the same weight for every lift?", "answer": "Yes. CrossFit gives one load, 135 lb / 95 lb, for the thrusters, push presses and bench presses."}, {"question": "Who was Roney?", "answer": "Constable Ronan Kerr, 25, of the Police Service of Northern Ireland. He was killed on April 2, 2011, by a car bomb outside his home in Omagh."}]'::jsonb,
