   'Ryan SO honors Detective Ryan Yeong-Ung So, 38, of the Scottsdale, Arizona, Police Department. He died on June 13, 2024, while executing a warrant with the department''s SWAT and special assignment unit. He also served in the U.S. Navy and was active in CrossFit.

You run 1,600 m in a weight vest (20 lb / 14 lb). Then you do 4 rounds of 9 power cleans (135 lb / 95 lb), 2 strict pull-ups and 14 burpees, and 3 rounds of 13 box jumps (24 in / 20 in), 13 push-ups and 50 double-unders. You finish with another 1,600 m run in the vest. CrossFit says the vest is for the runs only, so take it off for the middle sections.',
   '[{"name": "Run", "reps": "1,600 m", "tip": "Wear the vest. Run at a pace you can hold, because there is a lot of work after it.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Power Cleans", "reps": "4 rounds of 9", "tip": "Catch the bar above parallel. Quick singles or small sets are fine.", "rx_men": "135 lb", "rx_women": "95 lb"}, {"name": "Strict Pull-Ups", "reps": "4 rounds of 2", "tip": "No kip. Start from a dead hang and pull until your chin clears the bar."}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "4 rounds of 14", "tip": "Chest to the floor and a small jump at the top."}, {"name": "Box Jumps", "reps": "3 rounds of 13", "tip": "Land softly with your whole foot on the box and stand tall. Step down to save your legs.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "20 in"}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "3 rounds of 13", "tip": "Chest to the floor and arms locked out at the top."}, {"name": "Double-Unders", "reps": "3 rounds of 50", "tip": "Stay tall and spin the rope with your wrists."}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "1,600 m", "tip": "Put the vest back on. Shorten your stride and keep moving.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
