   'Scooter honors Sgt. Scott Lunger, 48, of Brentwood, California, who was shot and killed during a traffic stop on July 22, 2015. He had served with the Hayward Police Department since 2001, including as a beat cop, on SWAT and the gang task force, and as a Field Training Officer, and he was acting lieutenant at the time of his death.

This one runs on a 35-minute clock with a partner. For the first 30 minutes you do as many rounds as you can of 30 double-unders, 15 pull-ups, 15 push-ups and a 100 m sprint. One partner works while the other rests, and you switch after each full round. Then you have 5 minutes to find a 1-rep-max partner deadlift. CrossFit does not explain how a partner deadlift is scored. Working alone, rest 60 seconds between rounds and find your own 1-rep-max deadlift.',
   '[{"name": "Double-Unders", "reps": "30", "tip": "Stay tall and spin the rope with your wrists."}, {"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "15", "tip": "Chin over the bar on every rep."}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "15", "tip": "Chest to the floor and arms locked out at the top."}, {"name": "100m Sprint", "reps": "100 m", "tip": "A true sprint. You get to rest while your partner works."}, {"name": "Deadlifts", "reps": "1-rep max (5 min)", "tip": "Build up in a few jumps and keep a flat back on every lift. CrossFit does not define the partner deadlift."}]'::jsonb,
