You run 1.5 miles, then do 8 rounds of 19 pull-ups, 19 push-ups and 19 burpees. Then you carry a heavy sandbag 400 m and finish with a 1-mile farmers carry holding two dumbbells (45 lb / 30 lb). CrossFit says only heavy for the sandbag and gives no weight. That is 456 reps in the middle and over 2 miles of running and carrying. The farmers carry at the end tests your grip after 152 pull-ups.',
   '[{"name": "Run", "reps": "1.5 miles", "tip": "A steady pace. This is a long workout."}, {"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "8 rounds of 19", "tip": "Chin over the bar on every rep. Break the set early."}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "8 rounds of 19", "tip": "Chest to the floor and arms locked out at the top."}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "8 rounds of 19", "tip": "Chest to the floor and a small jump at the top."}, {"name": "Sandbag Carry", "reps": "400 m", "tip": "Hold the sandbag on your shoulder or hug it to your chest. Switch sides when you need to.", "rx_men": "Heavy", "rx_women": "Heavy"}, {"name": "Farmers Carry", "reps": "1 mile", "tip": "Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand. Set them down and pick them up again rather than letting your grip fail.", "rx_men": "45 lb dumbbells", "rx_women": "30 lb dumbbells"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
